      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MINTER MULWEE (1) used the rails draw to advantage to get home last time at this track and distance (23.32) after charging straight to the lead, scoring by a nose. Drawn the rails again and rates the measuring stick. REBORN SCARLETT (2) was quickly into stride and burnt early from out wide where she gave a sight, finishing second (23.18) and beaten 1.3 lengths over 400m at this track. Must be included in calculations. COLD COLD NIGHT (4) could manage only sixth at last run before a break, copping a check in the run in a NG at Gunnedah and finishing 5 lengths from the winner (30.84). Key player if finds best. MY WEE LASS (3) dominated last start. Big chance on that form.",
